ship-armor-module-name = Dynamic armor module
ship-armor-module-description = A passive local armor matrix that absorbs damage to nearby hull, equipment, and floor tiles, then slowly regenerates its charge.
ship-armor-module-blackhawk-name = Blackhawk compact dynamic armor module
ship-armor-module-blackhawk-description = A compact corporate armor matrix used by Blackhawk PMC. It covers a smaller area and has lower capacity than fleet-grade modules, but regenerates charge after impacts.
ship-armor-module-blackhawk-flatpack-name = Blackhawk compact dynamic armor flatpack
ship-armor-module-blackhawk-flatpack-description = A flatpack used to construct a Blackhawk compact dynamic armor module.
nebula-gas-siphon-name = Nebula gas siphon
nebula-gas-siphon-description = A dual-facing Horizon Energy collector that pulls gas into the connected pipe network while the ship moves through dense nebulas.
nebula-gas-siphon-board-name = Nebula gas siphon machine board
nebula-gas-siphon-board-description = A machine circuit board for a nebula gas siphon.
nebula-gas-siphon-flatpack-name = Nebula gas siphon flatpack
nebula-gas-siphon-flatpack-description = A flatpack used to construct a Horizon Energy nebula gas siphon.
nearest-shuttle-teleporter-pad-name = Boarding recall pad
nearest-shuttle-teleporter-pad-description = Stand on this pad and activate it to return to the nearest other shuttle on the map. Used by Nosske-Eien R&D for rapid specialist redeployment.
nearest-shuttle-teleporter-board-name = Boarding recall pad machine board
nearest-shuttle-teleporter-board-description = A machine circuit board for a Nosske-Eien teleport return pad.
maco-licensed-pistol-name = MACo licensed pistol
maco-licensed-pistol-description = A reliable ballistic sidearm licensed for independent contractors by Midnight Arms Co.
paycheck-bratva-combat-suit-name = Accountant combat suit
paycheck-bratva-combat-suit-description = A discreet ballistic suit favored by Paycheck Bratva enforcers. It automatically injects emergency chemicals if the wearer becomes critical.
paycheck-bratva-combat-suit-helmet-name = Accountant combat suit helmet
paycheck-bratva-combat-suit-helmet-description = A sealed helmet for the Accountant combat suit. Its faceted visor conceals the face beneath it.
hme-synth-heart-name = HME reinforced synth heart
hme-synth-heart-description = An advanced Harmony Medical artificial heart with expanded metabolic capacity for trauma medication and toxins.
hme-synth-heart-fortified-name = HME cardioprotective synthetic heart
hme-synth-heart-fortified-description = An HME synthetic heart with reinforced life-support systems. It increases the wearer's critical and death health thresholds by 25%.
hme-synth-lungs-name = HME athletic synth lungs
hme-synth-lungs-description = Advanced artificial lungs that expand stamina reserves for prolonged exertion.
hme-synth-liver-name = HME filtration synth liver
hme-synth-liver-description = An advanced artificial liver with improved toxin clearance.
hme-synth-eyes-name = HME tactical synth eyes
hme-synth-eyes-description = Advanced artificial eyes with flash dampening and optical protection.
